                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ6y3VvqqrQjQRysukfD9Za44/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrM1QySmhjbE4wU0VZeldVeDBaMEZTVmtkalZWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Great that it\u0027s open every day, and the prices are quite reasonable. There\u0027s a cute Snoopy peeking outside, and the interior is also decorated with Snoopy elements—clean and modern.\n\nThe restrooms are great, and the dining space is comfortable.\n\nYou order by scanning a QR code, and they have a self-service plate return system. The food comes out fairly quickly, and the dishes are delicious with fresh ingredients. You can customize your order by choosing whether or not to add sauces, which is thoughtful.\n\nI love the thick vegetable and meat filling and the American-style pancakes, which are only available at McDonald\u0027s.\n\nAnd the pancake burger—these are must-orders! 👍🏻👍🏻 The peanut sauce in the peanut brittle soup is plentiful, making it moist and delicious. The sweet potato and chicken dish is very healthy, with sweet, icy sweet potatoes. The chicken is tender and not dry at all. The restaurant is always busy, often full, and the owner is very polite.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "每天都有營業很讚，價格滿親民的\n店外有可愛史努比在偷看\n店內也有史努比裝飾，乾淨新穎的裝潢\n還有洗手間🚾很棒，用餐空間舒適\n\n掃QR code點餐，店內採自助回收空盤\n上餐速度算快，餐點好吃食材新鮮\n可以客製化選擇要不要加醬之類的，貼心\n\n喜歡麥味登才有的厚蔬肉、美式鬆餅\n還有鬆餅堡，都是我們必點👍🏻👍🏻\n顆粒花生湯種的花生醬很夠，整體濕潤好吃\n地瓜雞肉餐很健康，甜甜的冰心地瓜\n雞肉吃起來滿嫩的不會柴\n店裡生意滿好，常常客滿，老闆很客氣",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Ray Hsu",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103364508190861336117/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeZQZ3NOCol9J1cBqbLAzst0xnBOFURmwkoh14GVvq4KT6ycigdg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-02-15T03:23:26.726388379Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrM1QySmhjbE4wU0VZeldVeDBaMEZTVmtkalZWRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrM1QySmhjbE4wU0VZeldVeDBaMEZTVmtkalZWRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442abaabed52deb:0x8e6b593f7ca4cbca"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ6y3VvqqrQjQRysukfD9Za44/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsT1Z6RTJVR1UzYUZsWlVXOUhTR05QYmpoR1NWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "7 months ago",
                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "On November 6, 2025, at 7:55 AM, with half an hour left before clocking in, I decided to dine in. After getting a menu and sitting down, I realized there were no pens. I asked at the counter, \"Excuse me, do you have a pen?\" Unexpectedly, a tall, slightly overweight young female server with mascara (not the one wearing clear-rimmed glasses) scolded me in a very harsh tone, saying, \"We now order by scanning a QR code for dine-in. If you give me a pen, I\u0027ll just draw on it once and then throw it away!\" Then she glared at me fiercely.\n\nSome breakfast shops provide pens, some don\u0027t. Why is it the customer\u0027s responsibility to remember whether each shop provides pens? Can\u0027t they even ask? They should politely say, \"Sorry, we don\u0027t provide pens. Please scan the QR code to order with your phone.\" Please retrain your staff. Thank you. (Later I switched to takeout, and I found that takeout involves ordering directly at the counter. If there are two or more people dining, and the menu is extensive, how can they remember the orders without marking them out beforehand? Or do they need to write them down first?) Also, the air quality inside your restaurant is extremely poor; kitchen fumes are spreading into the dining area. I have already reported this to the Environmental Protection Bureau and added it to their inspection list as a way of thanking the waitresses for their hospitality.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "2025/11/6 7:55上午離打卡時間還有半小時，想說來內用一下。拿了菜單入座，發現沒有筆，向櫃台詢問:請問有筆嗎?沒想到櫃檯一位高個微胖有刷睫毛膏的年輕女服務員（不是戴透明膠框眼鏡那位）用很兇的口氣教訓我說:我們現在內用都掃碼點餐，給你筆的話在上面畫一次那張就要丟掉了!然後狠狠瞪我。\n有的早餐店會提供筆，有的不會，為什麼顧客有責任去記每家店有沒有提供筆?連問都不能問?應該要好好講說\"不好意思我們沒有提供筆喔，要麻煩您用手機掃碼點餐\"請重新給予員工教育訓練，謝謝。(後來我改成外帶，發現外帶是直接跟櫃台點餐，如果是兩個人以上用餐，餐點品項多的話，沒有事先用筆勾選，要怎麼記的住多人餐點?還是會需要用筆先畫記。)\n另外，貴店內用的空氣品質非常糟糕，廚房的油煙都飄散到內用區，在下已經呈報到環保局列入稽查名單，以此來答謝服務員妹妹的招待。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
